{"id":"665755","name":"青红椒豆腐","author":"为自己取个独一无二的昵","authorId":"10807931","desc":"","cover":"images/665755/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老豆腐","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"一个"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"三个"},{"name":"蒜瓣","amount":"三个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材，一块老豆腐青红椒。","img":"images/665755/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青红辣椒切丝备用，蒜瓣切片。","img":"images/665755/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆腐切块备用。","img":"images/665755/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热油下锅豆腐煎。","img":"images/665755/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆腐一边煎好后再翻一面煎，同时放盐。","img":"images/665755/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把煎好的豆腐铲起来装盘备用。","img":"images/665755/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅热下油倒入青红椒蒜瓣。","img":"images/665755/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再倒入豆腐翻炒。","img":"images/665755/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀到入生抽就好了。","img":"images/665755/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成型。","img":"images/665755/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}